# "Whenever this land attacks, target player mills four cards": any player is a legal target, so Bot1 mills their own four
# cards - four Lightning Bolts after the turn-3 draw - while the unblocked Shark deals 4 to Bot2 (20 - 4 = 16). Bot2's
# library is untouched (Reef was not made to mill them).

